      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sycamore%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The terrain in Sycamore and the surrounding area is gently rolling and contains rich soil which was originally heavily forested.",
